{"id": "y0542", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Eating breakfast in bed while seeing a homeless person sh ivering outside your window may cause you to feel guilty. The contrast between your comfort and their hardship can easily evoke feelings of remorse or empathy, especially when witnessing someone struggling with the cold.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
