{"id": "y1030", "pool": "know-mmlu", "n_q_chunks": 23, "onset_chunk": 22, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The most likely explanation for the DNA sequence similarities between human and chimpanzee genes is that humans and chi mpanzees share a relatively recent common an cestor. So the correct answer is A. Humans and chimps evolved from a shared ancestor not long ago, which explains why their genes are so similar.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
